{"steam_appid":3616260,"steam_name":"MAZEBOUND: Hunt, Gather, Run!","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3616260/1583867208/b46f4c8d11a6e21c4bda64ca391af273241fdff9/1766948894/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766950162","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257181262/69822a77a85610f442006b2a463b76dead7ef912/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766950162","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616260/0620caff3ac3bdc15bf832c4dde3e38565bba8a3/ss_0620caff3ac3bdc15bf832c4dde3e38565bba8a3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787138526","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616260/b6493d3a884b9d094b6c66513dac2d30402c8f99/ss_b6493d3a884b9d094b6c66513dac2d30402c8f99.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787138526","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616260/db84a7c9155532ec8f48e7be87b452d0b1722921/ss_db84a7c9155532ec8f48e7be87b452d0b1722921.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787138526","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616260/a8ce5e51bbc0b927c7852440aae0071221021d76/ss_a8ce5e51bbc0b927c7852440aae0071221021d76.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787138526","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616260/bffe4fb798fafc2a806a3f43830c0623cac36742/ss_bffe4fb798fafc2a806a3f43830c0623cac36742.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787138526"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With boundless sea at your back and a towering gate ahead, you have no choice but to walk into the maze. Hunt, gather, and run to survive, alone or with friends. In this survival horror, you're not the only one watching. You're not the only one starving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Your Own Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one is waiting around the corner to guide you. The only allies are the ones you bring: your friends. So choose wisely, plan carefully, and think outside the box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear branches for torches. Break crates for scraps. Build crude defenses, light your path, and hold your ground when the maze closes in. Everything you carry, you earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616260/extras/62272c5c7b8df47b80e91d721527f222.poster.avif?t=1787138526\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616260/extras/62272c5c7b8df47b80e91d721527f222.webm?t=1787138526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616260/extras/62272c5c7b8df47b80e91d721527f222.mp4?t=1787138526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather and Endure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just because it’s quiet or the view looks good doesn’t mean it’s safe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons from wood, stone, and scrap to defend yourself. Hunt for food, light fires, pick berries, and collect anything that helps you survive. Do not linger in one spot for too long...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616260/extras/d1bf1a33db6bb959f42c849863f926a4.poster.avif?t=1787138526\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616260/extras/d1bf1a33db6bb959f42c849863f926a4.webm?t=1787138526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616260/extras/d1bf1a33db6bb959f42c849863f926a4.mp4?t=1787138526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face What Haunts You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maze isn’t empty. It's alive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll encounter twisted beings shaped by hunger, curiosity, or something worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some like to crawl. Some like to wait. Some mimic what once was human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to keep moving. No. Matter. What.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616260/extras/6fb06023744465120412bbc9c97c850c.poster.avif?t=1787138526\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616260/extras/6fb06023744465120412bbc9c97c850c.webm?t=1787138526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616260/extras/6fb06023744465120412bbc9c97c850c.mp4?t=1787138526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD R9 380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX®-compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Microphone recommended - monsters can hear you.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":[" Absam Studios"],"publishers":[" Absam Studios"],"release_date":"May 13, 2026"}